<%#
# «Обновить лимиты по тарифу» on the card

Writes the numbers of the plan, as they are now, into the limits that follow the plan («Как в тарифе») and nothing else: a limit
chosen for this account («Своё число», «Без ограничений»), the functions, the modules and the fine tuning stay (Accounts::SyncPlanLimits).
The block says what would change before anything is asked (it is drawn from the preview of the service), the button asks «точно?»,
and the answer reads the account again under its lock. Without a plan there is nothing to follow; when every limit already is what
the plan says there is nothing to do. The notes under the list say what stays and why.

## Local variables:

- `account`: the account (Account).
%>
<%
  sync = Accounts::SyncPlanLimits.new(account: account).preview
  state = if !sync.plan_assigned then 'no_plan'
          elsif sync.changed? then 'changes'
          else 'current'
          end
%>
<div class="admin-limit-sync hidden" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="limit-sync" data-state="<%= state %>">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
    <h3 class="m-0 text-heading-3 text-n-slate-12"><%= t('super_admin.limits.sync.title') %></h3>
    <p class="admin-block__note"><%= t('super_admin.limits.sync.hint') %></p>
  </div>

  <% if state == 'no_plan' %>
    <p class="admin-limit-sync__note" data-testid="limit-sync-state"><%= t('super_admin.limits.sync.no_plan') %></p>
  <% elsif state == 'current' %>
    <p class="admin-limit-sync__note" data-testid="limit-sync-state"><%= t('super_admin.limits.sync.current') %></p>
  <% else %>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5" data-testid="limit-sync-state">
      <span class="text-[13px] font-medium text-n-slate-12"><%= t('super_admin.limits.sync.changes', count: sync.limits.size) %></span>
      <ul class="admin-limit-sync__lines">
        <% SuperAdmin::LimitWords.sync_lines(sync).each do |line| %>
          <li data-testid="limit-sync-line"><%= line %></li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <% if sync.kept.any? %>
    <p class="admin-limit-sync__note" data-testid="limit-sync-kept"><%= t('super_admin.limits.sync.kept', limits: SuperAdmin::LimitWords.labels(sync.kept)) %></p>
  <% end %>
  <% if sync.held.any? %>
    <p class="admin-limit-sync__note" data-testid="limit-sync-held"><%= t('super_admin.limits.sync.held', limits: SuperAdmin::LimitWords.labels(sync.held)) %></p>
  <% end %>

  <% if state == 'changes' %>
    <div>
      <%= render 'super_admin/shared/confirm_action',
                 key: 'sync-limits', label: t('super_admin.limits.sync.title'), title: "#{t('super_admin.limits.sync.title')}?",
                 text: [t('super_admin.limits.sync.confirm_changes', count: sync.limits.size),
                        t('super_admin.limits.sync.confirm_note'), t('super_admin.safety.audited')],
                 url: polymorphic_path([:sync_limits, :super_admin, account]), submit: t('super_admin.limits.sync.submit'), tone: :primary,
                 trigger_class: 'button button--small button--secondary' %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
